WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.747 --> 00:00:02.380
(uplifting theme music)

00:00:02.380 --> 00:00:05.770
- If you can find an eye
cream that actually has

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.673
that peachy pigment, I like to dab it on.

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:14.113
And then what I'll do
is I'll wear this out.

00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:18.700
Instead of concealer, I will go around

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.313
with this eye cream on and do you see?

00:00:23.330 --> 00:00:25.740
The dark circle has disappeared

00:00:27.410 --> 00:00:31.380
at least, I would say, 60, 70%.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:35.280
Now I don't recommend putting
makeup on top of eye creams,

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:38.920
it can cuddle like cream
in a hot tomato sauce

00:00:38.920 --> 00:00:40.030
and you don't want that.

00:00:40.030 --> 00:00:45.030
So this on its own, not
only acts as a concealer,

00:00:45.050 --> 00:00:48.540
brightening and lightening the effect

00:00:48.540 --> 00:00:53.080
and look of a dark circle,
but it's also taming

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.200
the dark circle while you're wearing it.

00:00:55.200 --> 00:01:00.200
It's sort of a perfect
alchemy of skincare as makeup.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:05.020
And I love this, it's my tried and true.

00:01:05.020 --> 00:01:08.170
Run out, grab one, experiment with it,

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:09.830
and tell me what you think.

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:13.840
I wanna talk today about
corrective beauty makeup.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:18.840
So I'm gonna take our onyx
eyeliner from Flower Beauty.

00:01:19.640 --> 00:01:24.410
And as you can see, one eye
is just lower than the other.

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.550
So this eye is more open
and this one is more closed.

00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:31.200
So what I'm gonna do is I'm gonna put this

00:01:31.200 --> 00:01:34.000
on the upper water line
and it's gonna open

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:37.010
my eye to match this one, check it out.

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:42.010
So not in even the lash line,
only the upper water line.

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.130
Pretty amazing, right?

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:50.620
Let's see after I put some
mascara on for the final look.

00:01:50.620 --> 00:01:53.780
I'm done now and I feel like my eyes look

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:56.310
much more even than they did before.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.760
Corrective eye makeup in our waterline

00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.533
on the eye that's more closed.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:03.631
I have five minutes to do my makeup.

00:02:03.631 --> 00:02:04.672
Ready?

00:02:04.672 --> 00:02:05.505
Ha!

00:02:05.505 --> 00:02:09.343
Okay, the Supernova
Celestial Priming Whip.

00:02:10.270 --> 00:02:11.470
Yes, please.

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:14.430
I'm gonna even out my skin
tone, give it a lavender hue,

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:16.780
which lavender and beige are not only

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:19.520
a gorgeous design color combination,

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:22.680
but it's actually gonna
even out my skin underneath.

00:02:22.680 --> 00:02:25.150
Celestial Priming Whip, done.

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.910
Moisturizer on the lip.

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.088
I'm going to use the new Hollywood secret.

00:02:30.088 --> 00:02:31.960
(makeup rattling)

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:35.453
Get Real foundation serum.

00:02:36.580 --> 00:02:40.900
Don't forget to go up on the
ears and into the hairline

00:02:40.900 --> 00:02:44.240
because none of us wanna
be that 16 year old

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:46.010
with a giant baseline.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:49.500
Also do yourself a favor, wash your hands.

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:52.980
I'm gonna just demonstrate
and watch, if I didn't wash

00:02:52.980 --> 00:02:57.770
my hands afterward, this is what happens.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.410
The final touch.

00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:00.698
I wanna lock it in.

00:03:00.698 --> 00:03:03.365
(spray hissing)

00:03:04.630 --> 00:03:05.653
Spray powder?

00:03:06.795 --> 00:03:07.795
Yes, please.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:13.830
Just in the oily T so I can
be dewy everywhere else.

00:03:14.488 --> 00:03:17.405
(theme song music)

